  "title": "NASA Partners with Blue Origin and Launch Services for Future Missions",
  "summary": "NASA awarded a contract to Omitron Inc. for orbital safety analysis services and added Blue Origin’s New Glenn 9×4 launch service to its Launch Services Program Office for future missions. This marks a collaboration between the two organizations to enhance spaceflight safety and mission capabilities.",
